> Inspect the actual saved results

The native generator prerequisite is complete and editable above. The extractor runs the authenticated original frozen GraphDef; it does not substitute a learned feature proxy or fabricated outputs. Missing external TF feature/score recordings are not treated as successful comparisons. No substitute score is reported as an original benchmark result.

> Actual frozen-extractor metrics

All variants use the same original extractor and fixed32-image pools. FID zero for a held-out copy is a diagnostic of metric limitations; small-sample FID is biased, and ImageNet IS is not CIFAR class accuracy.

| Variant | FID | Inception score |
|---|---:|---:|

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/gan_diagnostics_scores.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){std::ifstream in("build/nn-completion/models/gan_diagnostics/scores.tsv");std::string line;std::getline(in,line);std::vector<double>x,fid,is;std::vector<std::string>names;while(std::getline(in,line)){std::istringstream row(line);std::string name;double f,s;if(row>>name>>f>>s){x.push_back(x.size());names.push_back(name);fid.push_back(f);is.push_back(s);std::print("| {} | {:.6f} | {:.6f} |\n",name,f,s);}}if(x.size()!=6)throw std::runtime_error("six actual GAN variants required");auto layout=dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1,2);auto a=dm::graphics::RPlot::create();a.bars(x,fid,"FID",{37,99,235}).title("Original Inception features;32 images per variant").x_label("Variant index; see table").y_label("Low-rank Frechet distance");auto c=dm::graphics::RPlot::create();c.bars(x,is,"IS",{234,88,12}).title("Original1008-class Inception probabilities").x_label("Variant index; see table").y_label("Inception score");layout.add(a).add(c).size(1200,600).fit_panels().save_svg("build/gan_diagnostics_scores.svg");}
